<title>ITALY: Genoa first quarter 97 air cargo down 7.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Genoa first quarter 97 air cargo down 7.3 pct.</headline>
<text>
<p>ROME, April 21 (REUTER) - Cargo traffic handled through Genoa fell 7.3 percent in first quarter 1997 compared to the same 1996 period, the airport authority said.</p>
<p>Air traffic details are shown below.</p>
<p>    Genoa	     Jan-Mar	    Jan-Mar	     Pct Change</p>
<p>			     1997	     1996</p>
<p>    Passengers	 183,477.0	176,678.0		    + 3.8</p>
<p>    Cargo (Tonnes)     1,017.3	  1,098.2		    - 7.3</p>
<p>    Mail (Tonnes)	  626.8	    657.6		    - 4.6</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
